<main class="academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">service <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>Digital Branding</h1><p>Digital branding aligns how a person, project or organization is presented across its website, portfolio and approved public profiles. The focus is clarity and consistency, not manufactured popularity or guaranteed search results.</p></section><div class="identity-wrap"><div class="eyebrow">MBK GLOBAL · SERVICE OVERVIEW</div><section class="identity-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Project-specific service</p><div class="identity-links"><a href='/book-a-call'>Discuss a project ↗</a><a href='/contact'>Contact ↗</a><a href='/services'>All services ↗</a></div></section><div class="identity-grid"><section class="identity-card"><h2 id="section-1">Possible scope</h2><ul><li>Brand and biography consistency</li><li>Portfolio and project presentation</li><li>Content hierarchy and navigation</li><li>Official profile and contact link directory</li><li>Social preview metadata and visual assets</li></ul></section><section class="identity-card"><h2 id="section-2">How a project starts</h2><ol><li>Confirm approved names and descriptions</li><li>Use only owned or authorized assets</li><li>Link to genuine official profiles</li><li>Separate verified outcomes from plans</li><li>Review content and links periodically</li></ol></section></div><section class="identity-card"><h2 id="section-3">Cost and timing</h2><p>Cost and delivery timing depend on scope, content readiness, integrations, third-party services, testing and revision needs. A quotation should be provided only after the requirements are reviewed. No search ranking, traffic, conversion or security outcome is guaranteed.</p></section><section class="identity-card"><h2 id="section-4">Related pages</h2><div class="identity-links"><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder profile ↗</a><a href='/projects'>Projects ↗</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs ↗</a><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a call ↗</a></div></section></div><section aria-label="Related MBK portfolio pages" class="mbk-related-links"><h2>Explore related MBK pages</h2><p>Continue exploring Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects and practical digital technology resources.</p><ul><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology</a></li><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global</a></li><li><a href='/projects'>Projects by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/services'>Web Development, AI, APIs &amp; SEO Services | Bakhtawar Khan</a></li><li><a href='/resources'>Web Development, API, SEO &amp; Accessibility Resources | MBK</a></li><li><a href='/blog'>Articles &amp; Guides by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/official-links'>Official Links &amp; Projects</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/web-development'>Web Development Services</a></li><li><a href='/personal-branding-and-online-identity'>Building a Consistent Personal Brand Online | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/content-strategy-and-search-intent'>Writing Useful Website Content | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li></ul></section><div data-portrait-track data-caption="A personal archive / Bakhtawar Khan"></div></main>
